 "about": "Modwerk's Digitakt mk1 base for OS 1.53 and 1.54 (interface 2.1, sdk/digitakt/core/interface.json), built by scripts/elemod-base.mjs from Modwerk's October core (sdk/elemod/core) and this folder. It owns the boot, the seven events, the SRC machines of core_machines and the SRC and LFO pages of machines that describe their own, with ev_render_voices. A value given per OS ({\"1.53\": ..., \"1.54\": ...}) differs between the two. Sites name the stock bytes they displace by length and SHA-256 only; every displaced instruction is re-authored in the sources.",
